WEBVTT

00:01:28.126 --> 00:01:31.629
Tez aylanayotgan karuselga
sakrab tushayotganingizni tasavvur qiling

00:01:31.629 --> 00:01:34.298
toshga bog’langan arqonni ushlab turganda.

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:40.555
Karusel aylanishda davom etar ekan,
tosh va arqon gorizontal holatda qoladi,

00:01:40.555 --> 00:01:43.349
markazdan qochma kuch ta’sirida
yuqorida saqlanadi.

00:01:43.683 --> 00:01:48.437
Agar siz arqonni ushlab tursangiz,
bu aniq, inertial tezlanishni his qilasiz

00:01:48.437 --> 00:01:52.358
aylanuvchi karusel markazidan 
toshni tortib olish .

00:01:53.025 --> 00:01:56.529
Endi karuselni
Yer bilan almashtirsak ,

00:01:56.529 --> 00:02:00.741
uzun bog’ichli arqon
va qarshi og’irlikdagi tosh,